# pan-flick (h2-input): a fast 200 px drag released at speed, then the glide.
# Frames through 800 ms after release: the plane keeps moving right-to-left
# (center x falling, never stepping back) and slows to rest; the URL lands
# only at settle (no query mid-glide). Behaviour per frame against the
# reference's label frames at the same times.
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
wait 500
move 728 490
down
move 928 490 over 128
up
frames pan-flick every 100 for 800
